  m_text: '1  Seven bands of rows, from tomatoes here to the mango and orange orchard
    at the far end. Each row''s sign names its disease.

    2  Point at any plant
    in a row and pull the trigger, or pinch, to select it and its disease.

    3 
    Press <b>Enter Lab</b> to study that disease''s leaf. Up close, selecting also
    shows sample leaves.'
